Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='onefulfillment', at=datetime(2026, 9, 3, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="A todo's history is one fulfillment function, a Piecewise derived by flatten", body="*A todo's history is one fulfillment function* (2026-09-03): every transition — a spec revision, a completion (flat 1.0 from that instant), a reopening — is a `Piece` of one `fpl.Piecewise`, derived by prodrome `flatten`, never authored. Nothing rewrites the curve before its instant; today's number and a todo's thirty days are that term at an instant and across a window. Pricing a todo by its bare spec is a bug. The environment is time-indexed the same way (`prodrome.History`, read per knot; `fpl.bound` gates a snapshot's binding on its instant). The law: append any later event and every earlier moment reads the same (random logs, in the Prodrome's `core/tests`, beside the constructor laws `mk_piecewise`: unit, join, no repeats).", rationale='Decided 2026-09-03.', supersedes=()))